### What did I learn this week?

This week in I&S, we compared different types of government, including monarchies and anarchy. We discussed how they work and which system we think is better. In my opinion, anarchy is the best because I like the idea of people having freedom without rulers controlling them.

### What was challenging?

The challenging part was comparing different systems and thinking about their advantages and disadvantages. I had to think about how a society could work without a government.

### What question do I still have?

If there is no government or ruler, how would people make rules, solve disagreements, and keep everyone safe?

### What do I want to improve?

I want to get better at explaining my political opinions with strong evidence. Instead of just saying that anarchy is the best, I want to explain why I think so and understand the arguments against it.
